## 22. Conclusion

The **Project Demonstration Phase** showcases the completed **PocketSmart AI: Your Smart Budget Recommendation Assistant** and proves that the developed system meets its intended objectives. Through a step-by-step demonstration of **login, income management, expense tracking, budgeting, spending analysis, AI recommendations, financial goals, and reporting**, the evaluator can understand both the functionality and practical benefits of the project.

The demonstration serves as the final presentation of the project's **requirements, design, development, testing, and final implementation**.
